
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About | Crochet Project</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/about.css">
</head>
<body>
    <%- include('partials/navbar') %>

    <main class="page-content">

        <!-- 1. ABOUT THE WEBSITE -->
        <section class="about-section">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h1>About the Website</h1>
                <p>
                    This website is a place for crochet enthusiasts
                    to discover new projects, share their creations,
                    and organize their crochet journey.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Users can explore projects shared by the community,
                    save their favorites, and track their progress
                    from start to finish.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-image">
                <div class="about-image-placeholder">
                    Website Image
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 2. MY PURPOSE / INSPIRATION -->
        <section class="about-section about-reverse">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>My Purpose/Inspiration</h2>
                <p>
                    My sister has always used her creativity and love
                    for crochet to make beautiful things for me.
                    I wanted to use my own skills in web development
                    to give something back to her.
                </p>
                <p>
                    Just as she uses her craft to make my life prettier,
                    I wanted to use mine to make her crocheting
                    experience easier, more organized, and more enjoyable.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="about-image">
                <div class="about-image-placeholder">
                    Inspiration Image
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- 3. KEY FEATURES -->
        <section class="about-section">
            <div class="about-text">
                <h2>Key Features</h2>

                <ul class="about-features">
                    <li>
                        <strong>Discover:</strong>
                        Explore crochet projects shared by the community.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Save:</strong>
                        Keep your favorite projects in one place.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Share:</strong>
                        Create and share projects with other users.
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <strong>Track:</strong>
                        Organize your projects and monitor your progress.
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="about-image">
                <div class="about-image-placeholder">
                    Features Image
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
